WEBVTT

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:41.380
Sanada Yukimura waits atop that castle.

00:01:41.890 --> 00:01:44.880
Defeating Yukimura is our duty!

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.410
You know the job of the Flower Group

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:52.590
and that of Irori and
the Moon Group, right?

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.530
Yes, it's to make sure the servant 
and the Moon Group—

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.350
Idiot, you're too loud.

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:05.240
It's to buy time for the Snow Group
 to complete its task.

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:09.980
Let's hurry.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:12.820
We've only defeated two Insect-men.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:15.260
Yes.

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:22.070
<b>The Compassion Slash That Cuts G!!</b>

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:33.320
<i>I see.</i>

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:40.300
<i>So Princess Naa herself is 
beneath Wakayama Castle.</i>

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:47.250
<i>This is the best chance I'll ever get.</i>

00:02:49.150 --> 00:02:52.810
This is Koikawa-dono's style...

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.420
We'll follow him.

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:11.970
Illusion magic?

00:03:11.970 --> 00:03:13.580
Of course.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:19.100
But we defeated Kirigakure Saizou. 
Shouldn't the illusion be undone?

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:20.250
Yeah, that's true...

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:25.470
<i>Perhaps the illusion is fading 
slowly, like a lifting fog...</i>

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:28.960
<i>No, the illusions themselves are lies.</i>

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:32.240
<i>At least, according to their creator, Saizou.</i>

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.230
<i>No way!</i>

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.110
Oharu-dono!

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:42.680
Jinbei-sama!

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.530
You took so long, I came here.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.370
What?

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:50.120
Look at the dumplings I made for you.

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:53.620
Wow! Wow!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:58.130
Come on, come on! Come on!

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:01.920
I'm on my way now!

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:07.360
He's getting horny over an illusion.

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:09.930
Stupid Tsukishima!

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:16.660
What's going on?

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:18.730
An illusion.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:22.570
It doesn't matter.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:26.580
We're inside the enemy castle...

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:31.700
This time, I'm going on ahead, guys.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:37.560
When I cut through it, we'll know 
if it's an illusion or not.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:46.950
I could feel its weight.

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:47.720
This way...

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.610
Let us follow Koikawa-dono.

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:02.120
I thought that was Oharu-dono, 
but it was Insect-men!

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:07.360
Praise Buddha!

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:26.130
Come out, so I can slice you in half.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.020
Isn't anyone home?

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:37.090
Damn it.

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:39.350
That's wrong, Koikawa-dono.

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:41.770
Please try to remain calm.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.490
I want to do this.

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:48.290
That's all it is.

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:50.940
Honestly, you're so selfish.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:53.870
Hibachi?

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:55.400
Where's Tsukishima-dono?

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:58.620
Stupid Tsukishima was fooled by an illusion.

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:02.020
You can hear me, can't you, insects?

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:04.820
Your illusion ain't working.

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:08.380
I can smell fresh blood nearby.

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:10.790
Are you frightened?

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:13.640
I'll fight you!

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:17.760
Very well.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:21.150
We fear nothing.

00:06:27.140 --> 00:06:28.020
Tsukishima!

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:34.910
What's wrong, kid?

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:39.420
K-Koikawa-dono, they're strong...

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:40.970
They?

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:48.420
Looks like you'll be some entertainment.

00:06:48.730 --> 00:06:49.690
Be careful.

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:51.930
When they shed their skins, 
their strength increases!

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:03.450
More illusions?

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.700
Are you okay, Tsukishima?

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.570
That was wrong, Tsukishima-dono.

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:13.430
Any wounded will slow us down.

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:15.620
Hey, that's an unkind way to put it.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:17.870
H-Hibachi-dono...

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:22.620
Hibachi-do—

00:07:23.430 --> 00:07:25.130
You pervert!

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:31.180
Hibachi-dono...

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:35.150
Oooka-dono is correct.

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:37.140
Right now, our goal is defeating Yukimura!

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:38.640
Tsukishima...

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:43.270
However, I am a member 
of the Insect Magistrate's...

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:46.520
I shall not slow you down!

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:49.530
Tsukishima...

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:54.530
Ouch...

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.290
You guys, go on ahead!

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:02.810
Leave this to me.

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:04.020
Koikawa-dono...

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:06.370
That's wrong.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:08.170
When people say that, 
it's a harbinger of death.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:11.850
Oooka-dono!

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:15.050
Koikawa-dono is strong enough 
to overcome a herring of death!

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:18.810
Let's go, everyone.

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:22.240
Stop wasting my time...

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.940
I know you're there!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:39.950
Praise to Amida Buddha.

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:46.020
I am one of the Ten Crucifix Insects,

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:48.460
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Miyoshi Seikai Nyuudou.</b>

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:48.460
Miyoshi Seikai Nyuudou.

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:52.510
And I am Miyoshi Isa Nyuudou.

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:53.470
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Miyoshi Isa Nyuudou</b>

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:57.850
Before you join the ranks of 
the dead, we shall ask you...

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:01.040
What is your name?

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.560
Forget it.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:07.350
Giving my name to those who will be dead 
in a few minutes is a waste of time.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:15.530
I heard you guys get really strong 
when you shed your skins...

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:19.050
But if you die before you can, 
wouldn't that be it?

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:24.300
I'm right, huh?

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:25.500
In that case...

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:30.460
How about just shedding your skins now?

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:35.260
I don't want this ending too fast.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.280
This isn't my lucky day...

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.830
That's the end.

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:07.400
That won't work...

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:09.460
It won't work at all.

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:15.130
Our bodies are those of G, meaning cock...

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:15.800
...roaches.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.800
We are the hardest to kill of all insects.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:25.810
With our regenerative ability, your attacks...

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:29.270
...hurt less than a mosquito bite.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:32.770
Praise to Amida Buddha.

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:36.530
That's more like it.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:52.500
Too weak.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:01.590
That's wrong, Oooka-dono!

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:06.100
Take back what you said about 
Koikawa-dono being weaker.

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:12.060
I can't imagine Koikawa-dono losing 
any more than I can Mugai-dono!

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:18.530
Regarding the Insect-men, my one 
fear is Koikawa-dono himself.

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:23.560
Everyone who knew him long ago,

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:27.120
but sees him now, says the same thing...

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:31.050
That Koikawa Shungiku is far weaker now

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:33.970
than he was before he joined the Magistrate's.

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:50.980
You do not even warrant the 
Crucifix Insects' attention.

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:56.730
We should be pitied for having 
to fight one so weak.

00:11:57.220 --> 00:11:58.730
Shut up!

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:02.570
<i>Repentance Slash!</i>

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:08.740
I won't let anyone insult 
Koikawa-dono, not even you.

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:11.250
That is wrong, Tsukishima-dono...

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.120
Please do not misunderstand.

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:18.630
It's true that he's currently very strong.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:22.880
But the famous criminal, the Killer of 99,

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:28.890
was far stronger than the man you know.

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:37.550
It's useless.

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:38.980
Useless.

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:42.990
No slash can damage us.

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:49.020
Damn it, they keep regenerating.

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:50.240
Fine, then!

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:54.120
Turning your back on an enemy is cowardly!

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.380
You are a failure as a samurai.

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:59.520
Sorry, but I'm no samurai...

00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:07.760
He's a fast runner,

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:12.640
but he fails to understand 
that we are cockroaches.

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:15.140
Praise to Amida Buddha.

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:18.290
Praise to Amida Buddha.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.070
Did you think you could escape?

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:26.530
It's simple for us to follow.

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:30.410
I didn't forget you were cockroaches.

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:32.030
But...

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:34.370
<i>Slice and dice!</i>

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:44.050
Even a cockroach will fall
when it's cut to pieces.

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:45.830
I understand.

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:49.540
Then you didn't merely run.

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:52.680
But do not underestimate...

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:54.060
...our power.

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:58.110
Crap.

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:07.950
Too slow!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:16.150
That hurt...

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:17.940
Interesting.

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:21.180
Among humans, those skills 
and power are rare.

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:24.260
And you have the same scent.

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:27.520
Very well,

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:30.180
we shall shed our skins.

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:38.480
Praise to Amida Buddha.

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:44.460
These are our true forms!

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:48.740
Our regenerative capabilities are five times 
that which they were a moment ago.

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:52.620
We shall add your name 
to the ranks of the dead.

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:55.840
Though I suppose we do not know it...

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:01.040
What's that noise?

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:02.130
I do not know.

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:04.720
Perhaps another illusion?

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:08.400
Or Koikawa-dono fighting the Insect-men?

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:09.880
That's it...

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:14.510
Why do you say Koikawa-dono has become 
weaker since joining the Magistrate's?

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:15.760
Because...

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:30.860
Because he thought his 
father killed his mother.

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.530
And Koikawa was following him.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:37.540
He killed anyone who got in his way,

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.730
whether government or otherwise.

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:44.400
But when Koikawa finally tracked him down,

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:47.380
he realized that his father was not behind it.

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:52.220
Until he located his father, 
he was strong as an ogre.

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:58.220
However, after that, he lost his goal.

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:02.480
A killer is only strong as his kills.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.670
What's wrong?!

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:12.450
You smell of blood,

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:14.510
the smell of a murderer!

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:18.810
But you haven't slain enough.

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:20.330
A hundred, at most?

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:29.590
I'm sure the first murder was terrifying...

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:33.050
The second even more so.

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:36.950
But after the third, it wasn't frightening at all.

00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:40.290
After ten, it was fun.

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:42.600
No way.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.730
Liar...

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:48.580
Each time you killed a man, 
you must have felt it.

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:53.280
The pleasure of your skills strengthening.

00:16:55.940 --> 00:17:01.590
The feeling you derived from your 
katana surely became enjoyment!

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:05.170
<i>It hurt...</i>

00:17:06.270 --> 00:17:07.470
<i>It was so bitter.</i>

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:10.920
<i>I couldn't even breathe.</i>

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:17.360
<i>And the face of my father...</i>

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:19.960
<i>He wanted me to spare him.</i>

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:21.310
<i>To forgive him.</i>

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:24.990
<i>He actually cried.</i>

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:27.560
<i>My father, of all people.</i>

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:31.880
<i>A man who'd done nothing but beat me.</i>

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:35.290
<i>A man who'd ruled my life through terror.</i>

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:38.600
<i>He was begging me for his life.</i>

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:48.100
But as a murderer, you are incomplete.

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:52.590
Beyond a hundred or a thousand, 
you will cease to feel at all.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:55.560
The number will cease to matter.

00:17:56.040 --> 00:18:00.600
Only the fragility of human life 
will remain in your hands.

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:06.040
Praise to Amida Buddha. 
Praise to Amida Buddha.

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:08.790
That's why you're only insects...

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:09.400
Hmm?

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:14.180
Poor fool.

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:18.300
It would be so much easier 
to simply lie there and die.

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:19.240
Shut up!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.980
It doesn't matter how many you slay?

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:25.320
What are you saying, 
having taken someone's life?!

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:28.710
That's right, I'm a killer.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:31.630
I've taken many lives with my own hands.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:37.100
And the more lives I take, 
the heavier those hands feel!

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:42.640
Heavy like lead... Heavy like Hell!

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:45.580
Because you haven't killed enough.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:48.770
Another five hundred, and they'll feel lighter.

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:50.700
These arms will never feel lighter,

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:52.530
no matter how many hundreds I kill...

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:55.940
I'll live with this weight for the rest of my life!

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:59.140
How sad. How sad, indeed.

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:02.170
Saving the lost...

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:04.200
...is our task.

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:06.060
Praise to Amida Buddha.

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:07.580
Praise to Amida Buddha.

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:13.390
Praise to Amida Buddha. 
Praise to Amida Buddha.

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:15.510
Praise to Amida Buddha...

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:23.100
<i>Ever since that day...</i>

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:38.860
"I knew if I brought down my blade,
 I'd be following the same path as my father."

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:42.100
That is what he said.

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:45.160
A heart of compassion?

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:48.090
I don't know if it's compassion.

00:19:48.090 --> 00:19:50.250
I think it's something beyond that.

00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:53.000
I'm not an insect...

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:59.340
I'm an insect-slayer!

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:02.630
What is this?

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:06.140
Our regenerative speed is five times faster...

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:07.810
But it isn't fast enough!

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.650
<i>Compassion Slash!</i>

00:20:29.610 --> 00:20:31.120
<i>I'll keep on living...</i>

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:34.740
<i>For a long, long time.</i>

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:35.000
<i>{eyecatch}</i>

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:45.010
Koikawa-dono!

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:47.830
What are you doing here?

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:50.890
What happened to the Insect-men?

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:54.400
Killed two of 'em...

00:20:54.910 --> 00:20:57.550
What? Then that makes four!

00:20:57.550 --> 00:21:00.440
Three remain, and then, Sanada Yukimura.

00:21:01.050 --> 00:21:02.780
There's still a long way to go.

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:24.050
Justice awaits.

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.650
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:00.090 --> 00:23:02.150
My name is Anayama Justice Kosuke.

00:23:02.150 --> 00:23:05.850
Then I'm Tsukishima Shining Star Jinbei...

00:23:05.850 --> 00:23:08.130
And that's Loincloth Ninja Hibachi-dono!

00:23:08.130 --> 00:23:08.810
Wonderful.

00:23:08.810 --> 00:23:09.450
No!

00:23:10.590 --> 00:23:11.800
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>Who Is Righteous!? 
Tenma and Justice!</b>

00:23:11.800 --> 00:23:12.860
Who Is Righteous?

00:23:12.860 --> 00:23:14.000
Tenma and Justice.
